@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001

### Listar parceiros
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Filtrar parceiros
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners?search=ana&type=CUSTOMER&includeInactive=false&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Obter parceiro por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555666666
Accept: application/json

### Criar parceiro
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Silva",
  "taxNumber": "001.234.567",
  "type": "CUSTOMER",
  "email": "ana.silva@email.com",
  "creditLimit": 2500.00
}

### Atualizar parceiro
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/partners/11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555666666
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Silva",
  "taxNumber": "001234567",
  "type": "CUSTOMER",
  "email": "ana.silva@novaempresa.com",
  "creditLimit": 3200.00,
  "isActive": true,
  "version": "AQAA..."
}
